          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster may project his consciousness to follow the spell user that the caster currently has stored (i.e., whose signature has been stored with a Spell Signature spell, see the Power Lore spell list). The caster must know (exactly) the location of the target spell user. The caster's consciousness leaves his body and follows the target for the duration of this spell. While the consciousness is out of the caster's body, the caster feels nothing and is completely unaware of the environment surrounding the body. The consciousness can only see events around the target (no hearing)."
